<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss February trade data due March 19 at 1300 GMT.</title>
<headline>Swiss February trade data due March 19 at 1300 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's foreign trade data for February will be published at 1300 GMT on March 19, the Federal Customs Office said.</p>
<p>It revised the January trade deficit to 645.2 million Swiss francs from the 686.7 million shortfall first reported.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
